SSOS ESP32-S3

This distribution contains a TensorFlow Lite model representation derived from
TensorFlow example material in firmware/ssos_kernel/model.cpp and model.h.
Those files retain their upstream Apache License 2.0 notice.

The firmware builds against Arduino-ESP32, TensorFlow Lite Micro components,
ESP-NN, and other Espressif SDK components supplied by the pinned ESP32 board
package. Their respective licenses and notices remain applicable.

The benchmark under benchmarks/quark-v2-0.5m-pair-pipeline contains a
quantized representation of LH-Tech-AI/Quark-v2-0.5M, used under Apache
License 2.0, and a compact runtime derived from the MIT-licensed llama2.c
project. Its package-local THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and licenses directory retain
the detailed attribution and license texts.
